Step 2: Update the Dashboard (streamlitWin_app.py)

1. In streamlitWin_app.py, scroll down to the very bottom of the file (inside the Tab 3 section).

2. Look for the block of code that starts with team_accounts = {. You can press Ctrl + f to search team_accounts.

3. Look at the very last person on the list (currently "Faiz").

4. CRITICAL: Add a comma , at the absolute end of the last person's line.

5. Hit Enter to create a new line.

6. Type the new person's name and their target keywords using this exact format:
