Step 3: Update the Background Monitor (database.py)

1. Switch to your database.py tab in VS Code.

2. Scroll to the bottom of the file until you see the export_to_excel_team_report function. You can also press Ctrl + f to search, more efficient.

3. Find the exact same team_accounts = { block here.

4. Make the exact same addition you just did in Step 2. You can just copy the entire team_accounts block from the first file and paste it over this one so they match perfectly.

